     "steps": [
      "$252=1\\cdot 198+54$, $198=3\\cdot 54+36$, $54=1\\cdot 36+18$, $36=2\\cdot 18+0$, donc $\\operatorname{PGCD}=18$.",
      "En remontant : $18=54-36=54-(198-3\\cdot 54)=4\\cdot 54-198=4\\cdot(252-198)-198=4\\cdot 252-5\\cdot 198$.",
      "<strong>Résultat :</strong> $x=4$, $y=-5$ (vérification : $1008-990=18$). Les autres solutions sont $x=4+11k$, $y=-5-14k$."
     ]
